  << /ActualText (Problem\072 Redesigning meant handling change\055averse clients with high\055stakes workflows\054 who needed the new platform to do everything the old one did\054 and better\056\050My approach was to ask why each decision was made in the first place\054 since the original reasoning usually explains the problem\054 then rebuild the workflow end to end rather than patch the symptom\056)
